  "content": "<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">1. 操作步骤</h1>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<div>去github下载playwright-mcp 这个chrome扩展： <a href=\"https://github.com/microsoft/playwright-mcp/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com/microsoft/playwright-mcp/releases</a> ， 选择最新版本，手动安装即可。</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>在trae中手动添加mcp：</div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-json\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>\n</span><span>  </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"\"</span><span>mcpServers</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\"\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>\n</span><span>    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"\"</span><span>playwright-extension</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\"\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>\n</span><span>      </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"\"</span><span>command</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\"\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"\"</span><span>npx</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>      </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"\"</span><span>args</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\"\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span>\n</span><span>        </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"\"</span><span>@playwright/mcp@latest</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>        </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"\"</span><span>--extension</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"\"</span><span>\n</span><span>      </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span>\n</span><span>    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span><span>\n</span><span>  </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span></code></div></pre>\n<div>截图示例：\n![image.png](<a href=\"https://s.web.cafe/image/047b85fe7b5248ee837686259d4f0065.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://s.web.cafe/image/047b85fe7b5248ee837686259d4f0065.png</a></div>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>在trae中，直接描述即可：</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>打开 xxx</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">com</span><span> ，用 xx语言，为这个网站发表一篇文章。</span></code></div></pre>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">2. 好处</h1>\n<ol>\n<li>可以复用常用浏览器的登录状态，而不是重新开一个浏览器环境。</li>\n<li>可以自动发外链了。</li>\n</ol>",
